	"_doc": "The character's starter wardrobe. 'slots' are the parts that can be worn; 'sections' are the customise popup's Head / Body / Legs tabs and the rows in each, in order ('skin_tone' and 'hair_tone' are the colour rows). Each item has a 'style' the placeholder drawing understands and an optional 'colour'. Wearable gifts (gifts.json entries with a 'slot') join a slot once found. The first item in a slot is the default look. Skin and hair tones are the five swatches offered for the character (a sixth picks any colour). Facial hair is drawn in the hair colour.",
